  <Thumbnail>213b1e72-b746-47ac-9057-b6df6d8488e7</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="05-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (very confusing documentation. there is no explanation as to what all the various controls relate to. made best guess)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="05-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(macro ranges are not labelled or detailed properly and cannot be guessed. colour macro ranges and 112 pixel layout missing. charts contain control functions but no associated control)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="06-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="1" />
  <History Date="30-09-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 16, 32, 64, 14 and 20 channel modes in lines with latest charts in response to manufacturer request." Version="2" />
  <History Date="05-10-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's to new modes." Version="3" />
  <History Date="27-08-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed 20 channel mode mapping conflict.  Revised control names, updated function ranges and added mode number prefixes and 67 channel mode in line with latest documentation in response to manufacturer request." Version="4" />
  <History Date="29-08-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID for 67 channel mode." Version="5" />
